# This repo is public. Paywalled/copyrighted journal-article PDFs must never be
# committed here (citations, abstracts, and open-access-only text are fine).
# Blanket-ignoring all PDFs is the safe default rather than relying on manual
# vigilance each time one gets added to a project's Literature folder.
*.pdf

# Claude Code session scratch directory (isolated agent worktrees, local
